# Privacy Policy

Photo to PDF Converter - PDFio

Last Updated: August 31, 2026

## Introduction

This Privacy Policy describes how Photo to PDF Converter - PDFio ("we," "our," or "the App") handles your information. We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about our data practices.

## Information We Collect

### Photos and Files
The App accesses your photos, camera, and files solely to convert images into PDF documents. All image processing occurs locally on your device. We do not upload, store, or transmit your photos, files, or generated PDFs to any external server.

### Camera Access
The App requests camera access to allow you to scan documents. Camera data is processed entirely on your device and is never transmitted externally.

### Subscription Information
If you subscribe to PDFio Pro, your purchase is processed by Apple through the App Store. We use RevenueCat to manage subscription status. RevenueCat receives an anonymous app user ID to verify your entitlement. We do not collect your name, email, or payment details through this process.

### Anonymous Usage Analytics
To understand how the App is used and to improve it, we collect anonymous usage analytics through Mixpanel. This includes:

- A randomly generated identifier that is not linked to your identity
- Feature usage events (for example: a PDF was created or shared, a page limit was reached, a subscription screen was viewed) together with non-identifying details such as the number of pages in a document
- Subscription lifecycle events (for example: a trial started, a purchase or renewal occurred), without any payment details
- Basic technical information: device model, operating system version, app version, system language, and an approximate region derived from your network connection

Analytics events never include your photos, documents, file names, or any content you create, and never include your name, email address, or precise location. This data is used solely to improve the App and is not used for advertising and not sold or shared for advertising purposes.

### Locally Stored Data
The App stores the following data locally on your device using standard device storage:

- Your generated PDF documents
- App preferences and settings
- Daily usage counters (e.g., share count) for free-tier limit tracking

This data remains on your device and is not transmitted to us or any third party.

## Information We Do Not Collect

We do not collect, store, or share:

- Personal identification information (name, email, phone number)
- Precise location data
- Advertising identifiers (such as IDFA), and we do not track you across other companies' apps or websites
- Any user-generated content (photos, documents, PDFs)

## Third-Party Services

### Mixpanel
We use Mixpanel to process the anonymous usage analytics described above. The data is transmitted securely and stored on Mixpanel's servers. You can review Mixpanel's privacy policy at https://mixpanel.com/legal/privacy-policy/.

### RevenueCat
We use RevenueCat to manage in-app subscriptions. RevenueCat processes anonymous transaction data provided by Apple. RevenueCat also forwards anonymous subscription lifecycle events (such as trial starts, purchases, and renewals) to our analytics under the same anonymous identifier. You can review RevenueCat's privacy policy at https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy.

### Apple App Store
All purchases are processed through Apple's App Store. Apple's privacy policy governs how your payment information is handled.

## Data Security

All your content (photos, PDFs, and documents) is processed and stored locally on your device and is protected by your device's built-in security features, including device passcode, Face ID, or Touch ID. Anonymous analytics data is transmitted over encrypted connections (HTTPS).

## Children's Privacy

The App does not knowingly collect any personal information from children under 13. The analytics we collect are anonymous and cannot be used to identify any user, so the App is safe for use by all ages.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by an updated "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically.

